SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
    -m0 1.0
    -parms 1.0 10.0
    -cvode true
    -steps 1000 in 100 steps

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 sa = PARM(1)
20 k  = PARM(2)
30 rate = k*sa
40 moles = rate*TIME
50 SAVE moles
-end

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.tsv
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -kinetic_reactants Calcite
END
